  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingGuaranteeObligationsTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_NonConsolidatedMember">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:31.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;２　偶発債務&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:36pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;(イ)　他社の金融機関からの借入金等に対して次のとおり保証を行っております。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:0pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
